# minimal valid triangle with per-vertex normals and a triangulated face, in the v2 export
# format (v + vn + f "a//a b//b c//c", 1-indexed, vertex and normal index always equal).
# World space, Blender's native Z-up/meters, same as the v1 fixtures.
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
vn 0.0 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.0 1.0
f 1//1 2//2 3//3
